IV

Purpose

IV is the fifth major electrical tier of the progression.

This stage represents the transition into extremely advanced industrial scale, where production is no longer simply an automated factory and instead requires highly specialized industrial infrastructure.

The goal of IV is to introduce more complex production processes, higher-tier materials, high-performance machines, and multi-stage industrial chains.

