Power

IV introduces extremely high-capacity electrical infrastructure.

Power generation must scale with the extreme energy consumption of the machines.

Power distribution requires larger and more reliable industrial networks.

Energy storage systems become important for stabilizing production.

IV power infrastructure must be part of the progression rather than simply an auxiliary resource.

