Modern Industrialization Integration

Modern Industrialization acts as a complementary system to GregTech.

MI can provide additional machines, processing, and infrastructure for IV production.

Its systems must use materials and components compatible with the main progression.

MI must not allow the player to skip IV or directly access higher tiers.

